# BarnaMu — root .gitignore
# Note: C:\MuDev\OpenMU\ has its own (much fuller) .gitignore which handles
# all VS/build cruft inside the OpenMU tree. Patterns here apply to the rest.

# === Game client(s) — never push these to the public repo ===
BarnaMu-Client/
Client/
*.exe.bak
*.exe

# === .NET build output ===
bin/
obj/
publish/
[Pp]ublish/

# === IDE / editor / OS noise ===
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.cache
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# === Logs, temps, debug artifacts ===
*.log
*.pdb
*.tmp
*.bak

# === Screenshots ===
Screen(*).jpg
Screen*.jpg
